  "description": "## WELCOME TO THE\n\n# 💰 Bankers Guild 💰\n\n##### EST. March 7, 2024\n\n##### Founded by Joanropo\n\n ### ════════════════════════\n\n## 🛡️ Requirements 🛡️\n- #### **Combat Level 80+**\n- #### 70 base core stats\n- ##### Play Daily\n- ##### Join Assaults \n- ##### Be in Discord\n\n### ════════════════════════\n\n## 🚫 Kick Conditions 🚫\n\n- #### Inactivity for more than 3 days.\n\n*NOTE: Let officers and/or the guild leader know in advance about any situation that may affect your performance. If you don&#039;t communicate these issues, it will be grounds to be kicked out of the guild. \n\n### ════════════════════════\n\n## 🏰 Assault Schedule 🏰\n\n- #### Every other day at 9:00 am (GMT-5)\n\n### ════════════════════════\n\n## 🌐 Our Community 🌐\n\n- ### Bankers of Valor, for dedicated Hunters!\n- ### Bankers of Fortune, for those who want a more laid back raid playstyle!\n- ### Bankers of Tomorrow, for our new and upcoming recruits! \n\n### ════════════════════════\n\n## ⚔️ ***JOIN NOW!*** ⚔️\n\n### Our **MANDATORY** Discord Server\n\n### https://discord.gg/DcxtMcXCdG",
